              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.33.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 33:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wawe tayari kwa siku ya tatu; maana siku ya tatu BWANA atashuka katika mlima wa Sinai machoni pa watu hawa wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18+HEB.12.19+HEB.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 12:18-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe utawawekea mipaka watu hawa pande zote, ukisema, Jihadharini, msipande mlima huu, wala msiuguse, hata mapambizo yake; kila mtu atakayeugusa mlima huu, bila shaka atauawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkono wa mtu awaye yote usimguse mtu huyo, ila hakika yake atapigwa kwa mawe, au kupigwa kwa mkuki; kwamba ni mnyama au kwamba ni mwanadamu, hataishi. Hapo panda itakapotoa sauti kwa kufuliza ndipo watakapoukaribia mlima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akatelemka mlimani akawaendea watu akawatakasa, nao wakafua nguo zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
